;numPr&quot;:{},&quot;pStyle&quot;:{}},&quot;mode&quot;:1,&quot;preventFormatTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;propertyType&quot;:&quot;ParagraphProperty&quot;,&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;InsertText&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:&quot; &quot;,&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:12,&quot;len&quot;:0},&quot;preventTextTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;ModifyRunProp&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:12,&quot;len&quot;:4},&quot;property&quot;:{&quot;rFonts&quot;:{&quot;hint&quot;:2,&quot;ascii&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;,&quot;hAnsi&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;,&quot;eastAsia&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;,&quot;cs&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;},&quot;sz&quot;:{&quot;val&quot;:240},&quot;rStyle&quot;:{},&quot;author&quot;:&quot;p.144115233183346562&quot;},&quot;mode&quot;:1,&quot;preventFormatTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;propertyType&quot;:&quot;RunProperty&quot;,&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;InsertText&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;她始终以共青团员的先进性标准严格要求自己，怀揣服务师生、奉献校园的赤诚之心投身各类集体活动，在实践中淬炼青春底色，绽放奋进光彩。她曾主动报名担任第四十二届大学生春季田径运动会志愿者，赛事期间坚守岗位、履职尽责：赛前细致完成场地布置、物资清点，以严谨态度筑牢服务基础；赛时全力做好秩序维护、选手引导，用担当精神保障赛事进程；赛后高效落实收尾整理工作，凭务实作风圆满完成任务，以周全的服务保障了整场赛事的顺利推进。她还积极参与中北大学第二届学生体育文化节，在开幕式演出中，以昂扬的姿态和扎实的表现，展现出新时代共青团员的优异风采与蓬勃朝气。在一次次的协作与实践中，她不仅用自己的力量为丰富校园文化内涵添砖加瓦，更在服务奉献的过程中锤炼了统筹协调、沟通协作的能力，全方位提升了自身综合素养，以实际行动践行共青团员的责任与使命。&quot;,&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:16,&quot;len&quot;:0},&quot;preventTextTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;ModifyRunProp&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:16,&quot;len&quot;:360},&quot;property&quot;:{&quot;rFonts&quot;:{&quot;ascii&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;,&quot;hAnsi&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;,&quot;eastAsia&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;,&quot;cs&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;},&quot;sz&quot;:{&quot;val&quot;:240},&quot;rStyle&quot;:{},&quot;author&quot;:&quot;p.144115233183346562&quot;},&quot;mode&quot;:1,&quot;preventFormatTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;propertyType&quot;:&quot;RunProperty&quot;,&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;InsertText&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;\\r&quot;,&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:376,&quot;len&quot;:0},&quot;preventTextTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;ModifyRunProp&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:376,&quot;len&quot;:1},&quot;property&quot;:{&quot;rFonts&quot;:{&quot;hint&quot;:2,&quot;ascii&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;,&quot;hAnsi&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;,&quot;eastAsia&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;,&quot;cs&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;},&quot;sz&quot;:{&quot;val&quot;:240},&quot;isPlaceholder&quot;:true,&quot;author&quot;:&quot;p.144115233183346562&quot;,&quot;rStyle&quot;:{}},&quot;mode&quot;:1,&quot;preventFormatTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;propertyType&quot;:&quot;RunProperty&quot;,&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;ModifyParagraphProp&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:376,&quot;len&quot;:1},&quot;property&quot;:{&quot;spacing&quot;:{&quot;line&quot;:240,&quot;lineRule&quot;:1},&quot;ind&quot;:{},&quot;numPr&quot;:{},&quot;pStyle&quot;:{}},&quot;mode&quot;:1,&quot;preventFormatTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;propertyType&quot;:&quot;ParagraphProperty&quot;,&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;}],&quot;subStory&quot;:[],&quot;srcGlobalPadId&quot;:&quot;72dd998f-7e43-5258-8ea3-9accd6198cdb&quot;,&quot;copyStart&quot;:569}\" data-version=\"3.0.0\" inner_data_type=\"localData\" data-hash=\"f59b412a841412f8b4da2f430d2fb8ae\"></div><div><div><p>校园实践，彰显青年担当</p><p>她始终以共青团员的先进性标准严格要求自己，怀揣服务师生、奉献校园的赤诚之心投身各类集体活动，在实践中淬炼青春底色，绽放奋进光彩。她曾主动报名担任第四十二届大学生春季田径运动会志愿者，赛事期间坚守岗位、履职尽责：赛前细致完成场地布置、物资清点，以严谨态度筑牢服务基础；赛时全力做好秩序维护、选手引导，用担当精神保障赛事进程；赛后高效落实收尾整理工作，凭务实作风圆满完成任务，以周全的服务保障了整场赛事的顺利推进。她还积极参与中北大学第二届学生体育文化节，在开幕式演出中，以昂扬的姿态和扎实的表现，展现出新时代共青团员的优异风采与蓬勃朝气。在一次次的协作与实践中，她不仅用自己的力量为丰富校园文化内涵添砖加瓦，更在服务奉献的过程中锤炼了统筹协调、沟通协作的能力，全方位提升了自身综合素养，以实际行动践行共青团员的责任与使命。</p></div></div><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iU47DYoRliL8CbnsNW7Lmr7M774LRnZ2L4r7nzLiMzCaMmG0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyYLYh2nkh2UlCPLN78nmUiMz62MRAfnzGaMzAVUzLDnm6FLz9aL8WkU8MFLN-iU4NJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGsozLJqdbnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10793&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/123FDFAF12A4F4557F48AE0058EA36F7/1803BBCC/2B5C9\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"561\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iU47DYoRliL8CbnsNW7Lmr7M774LRnZ2L4r7nzLiMzCaMmG0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyYLYh2nkh2UlCPLN78nmUiMz62MRAfnzGaMzAVUzLDnm6FLz9aL8WkU8MFLN-iU4NJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGsozLJqdbnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10793&e=.png\"></p><div tdoc-data-src=\"{&quot;mainStory&quot;:[{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;InsertText&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;科创竞逐，彰显硬核实力&quot;,&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:0,&quot;len&quot;:0},&quot;preventTextTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;ModifyRunProp&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:0,&quot;len&quot;:11},&quot;property&quot;:{&quot;rFonts&quot;:{&quot;hint&quot;:2,&quot;ascii&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;,&quot;hAnsi&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;,&quot;eastAsia&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;},&quot;b&quot;:{&quot;val&quot;:true},&quot;bCs&quot;:{&quot;val&quot;:true},&quot;sz&quot;:{&quot;val&quot;:280},&quot;szCs&quot;:{&quot;val&quot;:280},&quot;rStyle&quot;:{},&quot;author&quot;:&quot;p.144115233183346562&quot;},&quot;mode&quot;:1,&quot;preventFormatTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;propertyType&quot;:&quot;RunProperty&quot;,&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;InsertText&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;\\r&quot;,&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:11,&quot;len&quot;:0},&quot;preventTextT