&quot;:false},&quot;propertyType&quot;:&quot;RunProperty&quot;,&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;InsertText&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;对待专业学习，她始终秉持认真的态度，取得了学分绩点4.08的优异成绩，专业排名达6/204。在科创领域，&quot;,&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:36,&quot;len&quot;:0},&quot;preventTextTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;ModifyRunProp&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:36,&quot;len&quot;:52},&quot;property&quot;:{&quot;rFonts&quot;:{&quot;hint&quot;:2,&quot;ascii&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;,&quot;hAnsi&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;,&quot;eastAsia&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;,&quot;cs&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;},&quot;sz&quot;:{&quot;val&quot;:240},&quot;rStyle&quot;:{},&quot;author&quot;:&quot;p.144115233183346562&quot;},&quot;mode&quot;:1,&quot;preventFormatTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;propertyType&quot;:&quot;RunProperty&quot;,&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;InsertText&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;凭借扎实的C/C++编程功底，在激烈角逐中脱颖而出，斩获蓝桥杯山西赛区程序设计一等奖；她主导的《青囊记》项目凭借新颖创意与过硬技术斩获中国大学生计算机设计大赛省级奖项，其牵头打造的《诗符律动》教辅工具，更以独特的设计理念与实用价值，问鼎全国大学生数字媒体科技作品竞赛总决赛一等奖。与此同时，她勇于突破学科壁垒，凭借出色的语言表达与思辨能力，在“21世纪杯”英语演讲校赛中斩获二等奖，走出了一条“专而能广”的全面成长之路。&quot;,&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:88,&quot;len&quot;:0},&quot;preventTextTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;ModifyRunProp&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:88,&quot;len&quot;:210},&quot;property&quot;:{&quot;rFonts&quot;:{&quot;hint&quot;:2,&quot;ascii&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;,&quot;hAnsi&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;,&quot;eastAsia&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;},&quot;sz&quot;:{&quot;val&quot;:240},&quot;rStyle&quot;:{},&quot;author&quot;:&quot;p.144115233183346562&quot;},&quot;mode&quot;:1,&quot;preventFormatTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;propertyType&quot;:&quot;RunProperty&quot;,&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;InsertText&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;\\r&quot;,&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:298,&quot;len&quot;:0},&quot;preventTextTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;ModifyRunProp&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:298,&quot;len&quot;:1},&quot;property&quot;:{&quot;rFonts&quot;:{&quot;hint&quot;:2,&quot;ascii&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;,&quot;hAnsi&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;,&quot;eastAsia&quot;:&quot;楷体&quot;},&quot;sz&quot;:{&quot;val&quot;:240},&quot;isPlaceholder&quot;:true,&quot;author&quot;:&quot;p.144115233183346562&quot;,&quot;rStyle&quot;:{}},&quot;mode&quot;:1,&quot;preventFormatTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;propertyType&quot;:&quot;RunProperty&quot;,&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;ModifyParagraphProp&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:298,&quot;len&quot;:1},&quot;property&quot;:{&quot;spacing&quot;:{&quot;line&quot;:240,&quot;lineRule&quot;:1},&quot;ind&quot;:{&quot;firstLine&quot;:480,&quot;firstLineChars&quot;:200},&quot;jc&quot;:{&quot;val&quot;:4},&quot;numPr&quot;:{},&quot;pStyle&quot;:{}},&quot;mode&quot;:1,&quot;preventFormatTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;propertyType&quot;:&quot;ParagraphProperty&quot;,&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;}],&quot;subStory&quot;:[],&quot;srcGlobalPadId&quot;:&quot;72dd998f-7e43-5258-8ea3-9accd6198cdb&quot;,&quot;copyStart&quot;:948}\" data-version=\"3.0.0\" inner_data_type=\"localData\" data-hash=\"98683486d992d7835798d552bd3b334e\"></div><div><div><p>科创竞逐，彰显硬核实力</p><p>她深耕专业赛道，不断突破自我，实现多元能力突围。对待专业学习，她始终秉持认真的态度，取得了学分绩点4.08的优异成绩，专业排名达6/204。在科创领域，凭借扎实的C/C++编程功底，在激烈角逐中脱颖而出，斩获蓝桥杯山西赛区程序设计一等奖；她主导的《青囊记》项目凭借新颖创意与过硬技术斩获中国大学生计算机设计大赛省级奖项，其牵头打造的《诗符律动》教辅工具，更以独特的设计理念与实用价值，问鼎全国大学生数字媒体科技作品竞赛总决赛一等奖。与此同时，她勇于突破学科壁垒，凭借出色的语言表达与思辨能力，在“21世纪杯”英语演讲校赛中斩获二等奖，走出了一条“专而能广”的全面成长之路。</p></div></div><p><img sr